WEBVTT

00:02:29.076 --> 00:02:33.716
So, for Singapore and for cities I plan,

00:02:33.716 --> 00:02:38.756
I look for the design gene
of that locality,

00:02:38.796 --> 00:02:41.396
to give it its unique character.

00:02:41.396 --> 00:02:44.316
Now, what are the key design genes?

00:02:44.316 --> 00:02:47.876
You see, different localities
have different characteristics.

00:02:47.876 --> 00:02:50.836
For example, they have
different climates --

00:02:50.836 --> 00:02:54.876
climates also affect
planning and design --

00:02:54.876 --> 00:02:57.196
and they also have different customs,

00:02:57.236 --> 00:03:02.756
and that also affects what you put
into the city plan or design.